{"label_alt_en":["Draft scheme of the Committee : procedure: Arts. 20/23","procedure: Arts. 20/23"],"label_alt_fr":["Avant-projet soumis par le Comité de rédaction : procedure: Arts. 20/23","procedure: Arts. 20/23"],"broader":[{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.procedure-of-the-court","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Procédure de la Cour","pref_en":"Procedure of the Court","is_facet":null}],"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","issues":[],"pages":[602,652,666,667],"pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, articles 20–23","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, articles 20 à 23","printed":["t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction.procedure-arts-20-23"],"related":[],"label_scope_note_en":"The Committee considered articles 20 to 23 of the procedure section of the drafting committee's scheme.","type":"concept","direct_count":70,"propagated_count":70,"breadcrumb_paths":[[{"id":"facet.committee","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Travaux du Comité","pref_en":"The Committee's own work","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, articles 20 à 23","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, articles 20–23","is_facet":null}],[{"id":"facet.nature","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Nature et établissement de la Cour","pref_en":"Nature & establishment of the Court","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, articles 20 à 23","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, articles 20–23","is_facet":null}],[{"id":"facet.procedure","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Procédure","pref_en":"Procedure","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.procedure-of-the-court","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Procédure de la Cour","pref_en":"Procedure of the Court","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, articles 20 à 23","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, articles 20–23","is_facet":null}]],"narrower":[],"printed_entries":[{"entries":[{"article_ref":{"art":"20","part":"procedure","range":[20,23]},"label_heading":"Avant-projet soumis par le Comité de rédaction","id":"fr.0027.37","lang":"fr","qualifier":null,"raw":"Arts. 20/23 — 592, 642, 656 (15), 657 (22bis).","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":602,"printed":592,"raw":"592","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":652,"printed":642,"raw":"642","seq":false},{"art_qual":"15","flags":[],"pdf":666,"printed":656,"raw":"656 (15)","seq":false},{"art_qual":"22bis","flags":[],"pdf":667,"printed":657,"raw":"657 (22bis)","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":776,"sub":"procedure: Arts. 20/23"},{"article_ref":{"art":"20","part":"procedure","range":[20,23]},"label_heading":"Draft scheme of the Committee","id":"en.0075.37","lang":"en","qualifier":null,"raw":"Arts. 20/23 — 592, 642, 656 (15), 657 (22bis).","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":602,"printed":592,"raw":"592","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":652,"printed":642,"raw":"642","seq":false},{"art_qual":"15","flags":[],"pdf":666,"printed":656,"raw":"656 (15)","seq":false},{"art_qual":"22bis","flags":[],"pdf":667,"printed":657,"raw":"657 (22bis)","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":783,"sub":"procedure: Arts. 20/23"}],"id":"t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction.procedure-arts-20-23","label_en":"procedure: Arts. 20/23","label_fr":"procedure: Arts. 20/23","n_pages":4,"pages":[602,652,666,667],"parent":"t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction","printed_en_id":"en.0075.37","printed_fr_id":"fr.0027.37","see":[],"type":"article"}],"groups":[{"meeting":28,"section":"28","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0601.19","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":601,"printed":591,"texts":{"fr":"Au sujet de l'alinéa 2, M. DE LAPRADELLE appuyé par M. Fernandes exprime le désir que l'on n'étende pas aux juges nationaux le droit de marquer leur dissentiment, afin de leur garantir une plus grande indépendance envers leur pays.","en":"In connection with Paragraph 2., M. DE LAPRADELLE, supported by M. Fernandes, wished to debar national judges from the right of recording their dissent; the object of this was to afford them a greater measure of independence with regard to their own country.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0601.19","speaker_id":"lapradelle","certain":true,"name":"Albert de Geouffre de Lapradelle","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.02","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"LORD PHILLIMORE et Mr. ROOT s'opposent à cette idée. La question de savoir si les juges nationaux doivent pouvoir marquer leur dissidence est mise aux voix. En conséquence du résultat du vote, l'alinéa 2 est supprimé.","en":"LORD PHILLIMORE and Mr. ROOT opposed this. The question as to whether national judges should have the right to record their dissent was put to the vote. As a result of this vote, Paragraph 2 was eliminated.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.02","speaker_id":"phillimore","certain":true,"name":"Lord Phillimore","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.03","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"L'alinéa 1 de l'article est adopté.","en":"The first Paragraph 2 of the Article was adopted.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.03","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.04","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"Article 20.","en":"Article 20.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.05","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"Cet article est adopté sans modifications.","en":"This Article was adopted without alteration.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.05","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.06","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"Article 21.","en":"Article 21.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.07","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"Cet article est approuvé sans discussion.","en":"This Article was adopted without discussion.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.07","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.08","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"Article 22.","en":"Article 22.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.09","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"M. FERNANDES demande s'il n'y aurait pas lieu de déterminer la nature du fait nouveau en indiquant qu'il ne pouvait pas être connu par la partie en question. Le bien-fondé de cette observation est entièrement admis.","en":"M. FERNANDES thought that it should be stated that the new fact must be of such a nature that the party in question could not have knowledge of it. The justice of this was fully recognised.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.09","speaker_id":"fernandes","certain":true,"name":"Raul Fernandes","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.10","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"Dans cet ordre d'idées, LORD PHILLIMORE propose l'insertion d'une formule qui réponde à l'expression anglaise „due diligence“.","en":"In this connection, LORD PHILLIMORE proposed the insertion of an expression corresponding to the English expression “due diligence.”","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.10","speaker_id":"phillimore","certain":true,"name":"Lord Phillimore","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.11","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"M. DE LAPRADELLE propose la formule suivante :","en":"M. DE LAPRADELLE proposed the following wording :","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.11","speaker_id":"lapradelle","certain":true,"name":"Albert de Geouffre de Lapradelle","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.12","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"„Et que, même en faisant toute diligence, la partie ne pouvait connaître...“","en":"“And that, even by the use of due diligence, the party could not have knowledge of...”","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.12","speaker_id":"lapradelle","certain":true,"name":"Albert de Geouffre de Lapradelle","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.13","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"La rédaction de l'alinéa est réservée.","en":"The wording of the Paragraph was reserved.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.13","speaker_id":"lapradelle","certain":true,"name":"Albert de Geouffre de Lapradelle","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.14","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"Les alinéas 2, 3 et 4 sont mis au vote et adoptés. L'alinéa 1 est adopté en principe.","en":"Paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 were put to the vote and adopted. Paragraph 1 was adopted in principle.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.14","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.15","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"Article 23.","en":"Article 23.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.16","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"LORD PHILLIMORE expose l'institution de l'intervention dans le droit anglais. Il souligne particulièrement le fait qu'en Angleterre un intervenant peut s'associer seulement à la partie défenderesse.","en":"LORD PHILLIMORE explained the right of intervention as existing in English Law. He emphasised, in particular, the fact, that in England, an intervening party could only associate itself with the defendant.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.16","speaker_id":"phillimore","certain":true,"name":"Lord Phillimore","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.17","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"M. LODER donne des explications sur la même institution telle qu'elle existe dans le droit néerlandais : ce droit reconnaît l'intervention à côté du demandeur aussi bien que l'intervention à côté du défendeur.","en":"M. LODER gave an explanation of the same institution as it existed in Dutch Law. This admits of intervention both on the side of the plaintiff and of the defendant.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.17","speaker_id":"loder","certain":true,"name":"Bernard C. J. Loder","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]},{"seg_id":"s0602.18","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":602,"printed":592,"texts":{"fr":"Le PRESIDENT explique comment le droit d'intervention au cas où il s'agit d'une Convention générale constitue une extension de la notion de chose jugée. En effet, il est nécessaire de distinguer entre l'intervention du chef d'un intérêt né et l'intervention en raison d'un intérêt exclusivement…","en":"The PRESIDENT explained that the right of intervention in a case concerning a general Convention amounted to an extension of the principle of res judicata . A distinction must be drawn between intervention based upon an existing interest, and intervention for a purely potential reason.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0602.18","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[602]}]}]},{"meeting":30,"section":"30","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0652.01","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"et avec l'addition suivante: „sans pouvoir être motivées.\""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.02","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Cette formule est adoptée comme alinéa 1 de l'article 19, contre l'abstention de M. DE LAPRADELLE; celui-ci s'abstient parce qu'il n'a pas pu saisir la proposition."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.03","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Au sujet de l'alinéa 2, M. de Lapradelle désire que les juges nationaux soient exclus du droit de marquer leur dissentiment, afin de leur garantir une plus grande liberté envers leur pays."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.04","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"LORD PHILLIMORE et Mr. ROOT s'opposent à cette idée."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.05","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La question de savoir si les juges nationaux doivent pouvoir marquer la dissidence est mise aux voix."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.06","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"En conséquence du résultat du vote, l'alinéa 2 est supprimé."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.07","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 20."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.08","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.09","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.10","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté (avec modifications)."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.11","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Sur la proposition de M. HAGERUP les mots „de la partie demanderesse\" sont substitués par les mots „de la partie qui demande la révision\", (fin du premier alinéa)."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.12","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. FERNANDES soulève la question de savoir si le fait nouveau ne doit pas être de telle nature qu'il ne pouvait pas être connu par la partie en question. Le bien fondé de cette observation est entièrement reconnu."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.13","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"LORD PHILLIMORE propose l'insertion d'une formule qui réponde à l'expression anglaise „due diligence\". M. DE LAPRADELLE propose la formule suivante: „et que même en faisant toute diligence la partie ne pouvait connaître...\""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.14","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La rédaction de l'alinéa est réservée."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.15","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté (avec une addition à insérer avant l'article)."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.16","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"L'arrêt est signé par le Président et par le Greffier. Il est lu en séance publique, les Agents dûment prévenus."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.17","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 21."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.18","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"L'arrêt est définitif et sans recours. En cas de doute sur le sens et la portée de l'arrêt, il appartient à la Cour de l'interpréter à la demande de toute partie."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.19","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 22."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.20","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La révision de l'arrêt ne peut être éventuellement demandée à la Cour qu'à raison de la découverte d'un fait nouveau de nature à exercer une influence décisive, et qui, avant le prononcé de l'arrêt, était inconnu de la Cour et pouvait l'être de la partie qui demande la révision. La procédure de…"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.21","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 23."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]},{"seg_id":"s0652.22","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":652,"printed":642,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Lorsqu'il s'agit de l'interprétation d'une convention à laquelle ont participé d'autres Etats que"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[652]}]}]},{"meeting":31,"section":"31","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0666.01","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 22 bis."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.02","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"CHAPITRE III."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.03","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"En raison de la décision prise lors de la discussion de l'article 24 (voir ci-dessus), M. RICCI-BUSATTI propose de formuler ainsi le premier alinéa de l'article 22 bis :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.04","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„La Cour exerce normalement ses attributions...“"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.05","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Alternativement M. RICCI-BUSATTI propose d'ajouter au commencement de cet alinéa :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.06","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„Sauf le cas prévu à l'article 24, la Cour exerce...“"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.07","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Sur la proposition de M. DE LAPRADELLE on se met d'accord pour ajouter au commencement de l'alinéa la formule suivante :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.08","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„Sauf exception expressément prévue...“"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.09","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Cette formule, mise au vote, est adoptée."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.10","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Le PRESIDENT ne prend pas part au vote."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.11","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Procédure."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.12","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 15."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.13","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Afin de donner satisfaction aux objections soulevées par M. HAGERUP lors de la discussion de l'article 29 No. 2, on se met d'accord pour insérer à l'alinéa 2 de l'article 15 les mots :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.14","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„non seulement que la compétence, mais...“ entre les mots „s'assurer“ et „que ces conclusions.“"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.15","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. Hagerup a des objections contre la stipulation que „l'autre partie peut demander à la Cour... etc.“. Il faudrait stipuler que la Cour a le devoir de prendre une décision."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.16","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Il n'est pas donné satisfaction à cette observation."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.17","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 22."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.18","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La rédaction de l'alinéa 1er, laquelle avait été réservée, est complétée par l'addition des mots „et que la partie sans faute de sa part pouvait ne pas connaître.“"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.19","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Sauf exception expressément prévue, la Cour exerce ses attributions en séance plénière."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.20","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Si la présence de onze juges titulaires n'est pas assurée, ce nombre est parfait par l'entrée en fonction des juges suppléants."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.21","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Toutefois, si onze juges ne sont pas disponibles, le quorum de neuf sera suffisant pour constituer la Cour."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.22","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Lorsqu'une des parties ne se présente pas, ou s'abstient de faire valoir ses moyens, l'autre partie peut demander à la Cour de lui adjuger ses conclusions."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.23","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour, avant d'y faire droit, doit s'assurer non seulement qu'elle a compétence, mais que ces conclusions, reposant sur des preuves sérieuses, sont fondées en fait et en droit."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.24","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La révision de l'arrêt ne peut être éventuellement demandée à la Cour qu'à raison de la découverte d'un fait nouveau de nature à exercer une influence décisive et qui, avant le prononcé de l'arrêt, était inconnu de la Cour et de la partie qui demande la révision et que la partie, sans faute de sa…"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.25","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour peut subordonner l'ouverture de la procédure en révision à l'exécution préalable de l'arrêt."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.26","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Aucune demande de révision ne peut être formée après l'expiration d'un délai de cinq ans."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0667.01","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":667,"printed":657,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 22 bis."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[667]}]},{"seg_id":"s0667.02","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":667,"printed":657,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Lorsqu'un Etat estime que dans un différend un intérêt d'ordre juridique est pour lui en cause, il peut adresser à la Cour une requête, afin d'intervention."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[667]}]},{"seg_id":"s0667.03","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":667,"printed":657,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Des objections sont soulevées contre l'expression „intérêts d'ordre juridique\". Ces objections n'ont pas donné lieu à des modifications."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[667]}]},{"seg_id":"s0667.04","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":667,"printed":657,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour décide."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-20-23","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[667]}]}]}],"histogram":[{"meeting":1,"count":0},{"meeting":2,"count":0},{"meeting":3,"count":0},{"meeting":4,"count":0},{"meeting":5,"count":0},{"meeting":6,"count":0},{"meeting":7,"count":0},{"meeting":8,"count":0},{"meeting":9,"count":0},{"meeting":10,"count":0},{"meeting":11,"count":0},{"meeting":12,"count":0},{"meeting":13,"count":0},{"meeting":14,"count":0},{"meeting":15,"count":0},{"meeting":16,"count":0},{"meeting":17,"count":0},{"meeting":18,"count":0},{"meeting":19,"count":0},{"meeting":20,"count":0},{"meeting":21,"count":0},{"meeting":22,"count":0},{"meeting":23,"count":0},{"meeting":24,"count":0},{"meeting":25,"count":0},{"meeting":26,"count":0},{"meeting":27,"count":0},{"meeting":28,"count":18},{"meeting":29,"count":0},{"meeting":30,"count":22},{"meeting":31,"count":30},{"meeting":32,"count":0},{"meeting":33,"count":0},{"meeting":34,"count":0},{"meeting":35,"count":0}],"members":[{"id":"lapradelle","name":"Albert de Geouffre de Lapradelle","count":4},{"id":"phillimore","name":"Lord Phillimore","count":3},{"id":"fernandes","name":"Raul Fernandes","count":1},{"id":"l